ctually, for \"both created the same document from scratch\", it's a document-level issue, not a field-level one. The threeWayMerge would go field-by-field, which doesn't make sense when there's no base. \n\nLet me simplify: when both branches create the same document independently, just compare the full content:\n- If equal → no conflict, take it\n- If not equal → document-level conflict\n\nLet me fix this.","signature":"b67f04da-c439-4df2-a55e-fca0714b6c12"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":140,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":65408,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e285a961-1a48-49d1-9407-6a92b42829e5","uuid":"40c4f9fa-f0ed-40a4-9db6-41996a21f12f"}
